            "review_title": "Review at Tiệm Cơm Thố Chuyên Ký",
            "review_text": "karng\n305 contributions\n0\nAverage Food, but Great Staff\nJun 2026 • Solo\nThe clay pot rice with chicken (Cơm thố gà) was somewhat disappointing. The rice was firm and lacked the fluffy texture. While the chicken was tender, it wasn’t very flavorful. It also wasn't served sizzling hot, and the serving size was small. The broccoli soup (Canh bông cải) featured fresh broccoli and a light, clear broth that was filling. However, the meat included in the soup was tough. Despite these shortcomings, I appreciated the warm hospitality and kindness of the staff.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 4, 2026",
